<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65058" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάρμᾰρος</span></b> , ὁ, a <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>crystalline rock</i>, which
			sparkles (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαρμαίρει</span>) in the light, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάρμαρος ὀκριόεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					12.380
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.499
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				663
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1172
			</span></i> (lyr.): as Adj., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτρος μ. ὀκριόεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.735
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1401
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later,
				<i>marble</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάρμαρον ἢ λίθον λευκήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					2.185
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Lap.</u>
				9
			</span></i>: also fem., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαρμάρου . . τῆς Πεντελικῆς μέταλλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					9.1.23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. λίθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					14.1.35
				</span></i>
			: hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>work in marble</i>, i.e. <i>tombstone</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυκτὴ μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					22.211
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>chips made by cutting marble</i> (masc.), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.660c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				954a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.79
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
